OL,3,GNEWSAFly-tipping at hospital 'putting
OL,4,Alives at risk'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFly-tipping near a hospital helipad is
OL,7,F"potentially putting lives at risk",
OL,8,Faccording to a councillor.
OL,10,FBranches, mattresses, children's toys
OL,11,Fand a suitcase have been dumped on the
OL,12,Fgrounds of Airedale Hospital in
OL,13,FBradford and is being investigated by
OL,14,Fthe council.
OL,16,FEarlier this week Prime Minister Andy
OL,17,FBurnham visited Bradford to announce a
OL,18,Fcrackdown on fly-tipping. He said fines
OL,19,Fwould increase from #300 to #5,000 and
OL,20,Foffenders could be given up to nine
OL,21,Fpoints on their driving licence.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
