OL,3,GNEWSAFly-tipping at hospital 'putting
OL,4,Alives at risk'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor George Buckley said he was
OL,7,Falerted to the "infuriating" illegal
OL,8,Fdumping at the hospital in Steeton by
OL,9,Flocal residents and had raised it with
OL,10,FBradford Council.
